{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-76-1","title":"Psalms 76:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A declaration of God's majesty in the church. 11 An exhortation to serve him reverently.</p>\n<p>(Title.) Neginoth. 4:1; 54:1; 61:1; 67:1; *titles A Psalm. This Psalm is entitled in the Septuagint, which is followed by the Vulgate and Appollinarius, [ ,] \"An ode against the Assyrian;\" and it is considered by many of the best commentators to have been composed by Asaph after the defeat of Sennacherib.</p>\n<p>of Asaph. or, for Asaph. In Judah. 48:1-3; 147:19,20; De 4:7,8,34-36; Ac 17:23; Ro 2:17-29; 3:1,2 his. 98:2,3; 148:13,14; 1Ch 29:10-12; 2Ch 2:5,6; Da 3:29; 4:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-2","title":"Psalms 76:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Salem. Ge 14:18; Heb 7:1,2 dwelling. 132:13,14; 2Ch 6:6; Isa 12:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-3","title":"Psalms 76:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>There. 46:9; 2Ch 14:12,13; 20:25; 32:21; Isa 37:35,36; Eze 39:3,4,9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-4","title":"Psalms 76:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>mountains. Jer 4:7; Eze 19:1-4,6; 38:12,13; Da 7:4-8,17-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-5","title":"Psalms 76:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>stout-hearted. Job 40:10-12; Isa 46:12; Da 4:37; Lu 1:51,52 they. 13:3; Isa 37:36; Jer 51:39; Na 3:18 and. Isa 31:8; Eze 30:21-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-6","title":"Psalms 76:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>At thy. 18:15; 80:16; 104:7; Ex 15:1,21 both. Ex 14:27,28; 15:4-6,10; 2Sa 10:18; Isa 37:36; Eze 39:20; Na 1:6 Na 2:13; 3:18; Zec 12:4 dead. 1Sa 26:12; Jer 51:39,57</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-7","title":"Psalms 76:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>even thou. 89:7; Jer 10:7-10; Mt 10:28; Re 14:7; 15:4 who. 90:11; Na 1:6; 1Co 10:22; Re 6:16,17 when. 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-8","title":"Psalms 76:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>didst. Ex 19:10; Jud 5:20; 2Ch 32:20-22; Eze 38:20-23 still. 46:10; 2Ch 20:29,30; Hab 2:20; Zec 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-9","title":"Psalms 76:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>When. 9:7-9; 72:4; 82:2-5; Isa 11:4; Jer 5:28 to save. 25:9; 149:4; Zep 2:3; Mt 5:5; 1Pe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-10","title":"Psalms 76:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Surely. Ge 37:18-20,26-28; 50:20; Ex 9:16,17; 15:9-11; 18:11; Da 3:19,20 Ac 4:26-28; Re 11:18 remainder. 46:6; 65:7; 104:9; Mt 2:13-16; 24:22; Ac 12:3-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-11","title":"Psalms 76:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Vow. 50:14; 119:106; Nu 30:2; Ec 5:4-6 let all. 68:29; 89:7; De 16:16; 2Ch 32:22,23 unto him. Heb. to fear. Ge 31:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-76-12","title":"Psalms 76:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":76,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":76,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>He shall. 2:5,10; 48:4-6; 68:12,35; Jos 5:1; 2Ch 32:21; Zep 3:6 terrible. Isa 13:6-8; 24:21; Re 6:15; 19:17-21</p>"}]}